            <div xml:id="d222">

                <pb facs="0222" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1942v02/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.30/181: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in France</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Tuck</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-07-04T15:00:00-04:00">July 4, 1942—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>413. Your 967, July 3, 6 p.m. It is true that our 411, July 3, 1 a.m. was sent
                    before receiving your 962 of July 2, 7 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department’s 411 of July 3, 1 a.m. transmits the President’s proposal as he
                    wishes it to be laid before the French Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
